  "description": "The Speedwolf V2 race frame is finally here! Building off the fan feedback and success of the original Speedwolf we stayed true to its still 4130 chromoly construction. To create the stiffest Chromoly frame on the market we developed proprietary shaped seat and down tubes that maximize the contact area with the B.B. and reduces flex. Other features include: 3-D CNC dropouts with integrated chain adjusters, included Q/R seat clamp and wider oval Chainstay bridge to improve resistance against side-to-side flex. Be first out of the gate to grab the Subrosa Speedwolf V2 and you’ll be first out of the gate on the track!",
